# Divan Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# These are injected into your shell profile (~/.bashrc, ~/.zshrc) by `divan install`.
# They are cleanly removed by `divan uninstall`.
#
# Lines starting with # are comments and are not exported.
# Format: KEY=VALUE (no spaces around =, no `export` prefix needed)

# Where divan is cloned
DIVAN_HOME=${HOME}/.divan

# Anthropic
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Hugging Face
# HF_TOKEN=hf_...

# Vercel
# VERCEL_TOKEN=...

# Supabase
# SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=...

# OpenAI (for AI SDK multi-provider)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# Telegram Bot
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=...

# Custom project defaults
# DEFAULT_PROFILE=full
